WEBVTT

00:03.173 --> 00:05.177
Tatiana, I made it to the top deck!

00:10.145 --> 00:13.318
I'd rather destroy everything
than let him get away!

00:13.569 --> 00:14.278
Wazzat?

00:14.696 --> 00:17.994
No more of this to someone special to me.

00:18.913 --> 00:22.504
I won't let you touch her...
not a single finger!

00:51.854 --> 00:54.317
Zombie! Do you see Unrepair?

00:54.526 --> 00:59.493
Oh, yeah! I spotted him all right!
And I have your ability to thank for that!

01:29.763 --> 01:31.517
What are we gonna do here?

01:31.684 --> 01:32.811
We're settlin' matters right here.

01:32.977 --> 01:33.729
Huh?

01:33.938 --> 01:36.568
These guys infiltrated
the ship from the top deck.

01:36.860 --> 01:39.281
They're bound to have a getaway plan.

01:40.743 --> 01:42.747
If we let 'em slip away,
Fuko dies.

01:46.129 --> 01:47.841
Brace yourselves!

01:47.841 --> 01:50.429
From here,
it's a Negator ability shoot-out!

01:50.847 --> 01:52.976
I'm gonna need that power of yours!

01:52.976 --> 01:55.188
I'm countin' on ya, Chikara!

02:01.325 --> 02:04.875
Just watch, Mom, Dad.

02:06.920 --> 02:08.549
Don't they ever quit?

02:11.597 --> 02:13.559
Unmove, on!

03:46.538 --> 03:49.670
<i>Tatiana faced two Negator Hunters.</i>

03:49.670 --> 03:52.676
<i>In her past lies memories of a solitary girl.</i>

03:53.093 --> 03:57.727
<i>Tatiana suddenly became the Negator Untouchable
on her fifth birthday.</i>

03:57.727 --> 04:01.694
<i>Compulsory Activation Type abilities
are unleashed regardless of will,</i>

04:01.694 --> 04:04.198
<i>and hers robbed her of her family
and the place where she belonged.</i>

04:04.490 --> 04:08.791
<i>Tatiana sinks into despair,
learning she can never touch or be touched by anyone again.</i>

04:09.125 --> 04:14.553
<i>Billy was the one that saved her soul,
and from then the Union became her new home.</i>

04:14.970 --> 04:20.857
<i>With such a past, Fuko is the first person Tatiana
can call a friend since becoming a Negator.</i>

04:21.315 --> 04:27.327
<i>In order to save Fuko's life,
Tatiana unleashes her power that she sealed away in armor.</i>

04:27.746 --> 04:33.131
<i>The Untouchable Area that spreads around her engulfs
the Negator Hunters and crushes all.</i>

04:33.423 --> 04:38.099
<i>Within the growing light of the Area,
Andy catches sight of Unrepair once again.</i>

04:38.559 --> 04:41.774
<i>The battle to save Fuko now begins.</i>

04:59.433 --> 05:02.105
<i>We're all frozen in midair?</i>

05:03.066 --> 05:06.155
<i>But with neither of us moving,
we're at a stalemate.</i>

05:06.865 --> 05:08.159
<i>Is this to buy time?</i>

05:08.326 --> 05:11.374
<i>Wait, am I stuck making a really ugly face?</i>

05:13.671 --> 05:14.463
<i>Hm?</i>

05:14.923 --> 05:15.925
<i>Oh, I get it!</i>

05:16.552 --> 05:19.181
Parts Bullet... Finger!

05:20.726 --> 05:21.770
<i>He missed?</i>

05:22.396 --> 05:25.653
<i>No... I know from our last little scuffle.</i>

05:25.653 --> 05:28.199
<i>There's no way that guy
would miss such a crucial shot.</i>

05:28.617 --> 05:30.580
<i>There must be some trick behind it...</i>

05:31.038 --> 05:34.003
<i>...but that finger did help bring something else to light.</i>

05:34.546 --> 05:40.725
<i>Why Card Guy is still able to move parts of his body,
despite both of us being frozen in midair.</i>

05:41.225 --> 05:42.436
<i>That kid...</i>

05:42.687 --> 05:45.358
<i>By keeping his arms and legs completely still,</i>

05:45.358 --> 05:48.406
<i>he negates the movement of just the parts he can see.</i>

05:49.408 --> 05:55.337
<i>And because Card Guy only has the right side
of his face and his right shoulder in sight,</i>

05:55.337 --> 05:57.634
<i>he can move any other part of his body at will.</i>

05:57.634 --> 06:01.390
<i>Meanwhile, we're stuck front
and center right along with that finger he fired off,</i>

06:01.390 --> 06:04.689
<i>meaning nothing over here can move.</i>

06:05.232 --> 06:07.737
<i>His ability is powerful,
but it has a flaw.</i>

06:08.112 --> 06:08.739
<i>But first...</i>

06:08.906 --> 06:10.785
Chikara, deactivate your ability!

06:10.785 --> 06:11.954
Yes, sir!

06:11.954 --> 06:12.956
<i>Unmove, off!</i>

06:13.540 --> 06:14.416
I can mo-

06:14.751 --> 06:15.586
Latla!

06:16.045 --> 06:17.882
<i>He added spin to make it curve?</i>

06:18.091 --> 06:20.011
Chikara, switch 'er on again!

06:20.011 --> 06:20.846
Yes, si-

06:21.347 --> 06:23.184
Huh? They're gone.

06:23.268 --> 06:25.063
Chikara! Up above!

06:25.063 --> 06:25.731
Up above?

06:26.357 --> 06:28.862
All right.
My turn now.

06:29.698 --> 06:30.616
ARTIFACT, BLADE RUNNER

06:30.700 --> 06:33.706
Artifact, Blade Runner!

06:34.039 --> 06:35.166
Here it comes!

06:36.043 --> 06:37.547
Chikara, you good?

06:39.383 --> 06:40.218
Figures.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.724
Fuko! Stretch your legs!

06:42.724 --> 06:43.433
Okay!

06:43.433 --> 06:45.228
Chikara! Tuck yours in!

06:45.228 --> 06:45.771
Wha-?

06:47.567 --> 06:52.451
<i>An Artifact! Son of a gun.
Had that thing up his sleeve the whole damn time, eh?</i>

06:53.327 --> 06:54.371
<i>He's been takin' me for a chump.</i>

06:56.626 --> 06:57.461
Andy!

06:57.670 --> 06:59.549
Aah! I'm sorry, sir!

07:00.050 --> 07:03.264
I knew it.
Your ability activation is inconsistent.

07:03.640 --> 07:06.228
Your scaredy-cat nature is your flaw.

07:07.272 --> 07:08.942
You... you jerk!

07:08.942 --> 07:10.278
Too slow.

07:13.744 --> 07:17.125
The next time you blink will signal your death.

07:17.502 --> 07:20.800
Not bad. Surprised you stopped 'em, Chikara.

07:20.800 --> 07:24.766
Um, actually, I'm just literally scared stiff.

07:24.766 --> 07:28.857
It all worked out in the end.
You can do anything as long as you're still kickin'!

07:29.233 --> 07:31.153
Fuko! Can I ask a favor?

07:31.153 --> 07:32.573
Sure! What do we do?

07:33.199 --> 07:38.000
We'll need to get past
that girl's Negator power to beat this chump.

07:38.251 --> 07:40.380
How come we can move our mouths?

07:40.380 --> 07:43.427
Because my shirt blocks his view of yours, too.

07:44.096 --> 07:49.899
<i>I haven't figured her power out completely,
but feints, like that curveball I threw...</i>

07:51.736 --> 07:55.536
<i>...and sneak attacks manage to slip under her radar.</i>

07:56.078 --> 07:56.788
Fuko.

07:57.372 --> 07:59.544
We're stakin' it all on your Unluck's random factor.

08:00.128 --> 08:04.261
Only problem? We need to get close enough
to roll him up in it.

08:04.469 --> 08:05.221
Roger that!

08:05.388 --> 08:06.056
Ta-

08:06.600 --> 08:07.768
Tatiana?

08:08.102 --> 08:09.981
I just have to launch you up, right?

08:21.086 --> 08:24.009
Untouchable Area Instantaneous Release!

08:24.719 --> 08:26.222
UNTOUCHABLE AREA
INSTANTANEOUS RELEASE

08:28.644 --> 08:31.273
It's up to you now!
Zombie! Fuko!

08:31.566 --> 08:33.654
You got it!
Leave it to us!

08:37.035 --> 08:38.914
Fine by me.
Bring it on.

08:39.707 --> 08:41.586
- The only one dying here is you!
- The only one dying here is you!

08:43.172 --> 08:44.174
Crescent!

08:45.385 --> 08:46.888
CRIMSON CRESCENT MOON

08:49.602 --> 08:51.856
That's a heavy blow.

08:51.856 --> 08:54.570
Can't get enough power
from only the waist up.

08:54.821 --> 08:57.325
That means defense is out.
Offense it is!

08:57.450 --> 08:59.789
Wow. Sweet katana.

09:00.164 --> 09:00.916
Andy!

09:00.916 --> 09:01.835
Yup!

09:02.586 --> 09:03.421
Whuh?

09:05.216 --> 09:06.761
Are they kissing?

09:06.761 --> 09:07.972
Wanna do the same?

09:07.972 --> 09:09.601
Get serious.

09:09.601 --> 09:10.351
Yes'm.

09:10.853 --> 09:13.357
Chikara. Listen up.

09:13.357 --> 09:15.278
A meteorite is gonna fall on top of me.

09:15.529 --> 09:16.405
Huh?

09:16.823 --> 09:18.952
We're gonna roll those two into it.

09:18.952 --> 09:22.375
But it's probably not gonna hit them because
of the girl's ability.

09:23.127 --> 09:24.797
We need your power.

09:24.797 --> 09:25.465
Huh?

09:25.799 --> 09:28.304
The hell's with all that chit-chat down there?

09:35.276 --> 09:37.280
Ah, crap! We're falling!

09:37.280 --> 09:38.032
Don't worry!

09:40.119 --> 09:42.499
My, how you've shrunk.

09:42.499 --> 09:44.670
Y-You mean to tell me this guy is still alive?

09:45.004 --> 09:45.714
Mr. Andy!

09:46.256 --> 09:49.889
Wh-What if I'm scared again
and ruin the plan?

09:51.392 --> 09:54.649
Don't sweat it.
The three of you guys...

09:55.274 --> 09:58.615
...have got what it takes to put your lives on
the line and act to help others.

10:00.326 --> 10:03.750
No matter the era,
when it comes time to seal the deal...

10:05.587 --> 10:08.969
...folks like that always deliver!

10:21.036 --> 10:23.750
<i>A meteorite? Intentionally?</i>

10:24.334 --> 10:25.462
<i>That girl's doing, eh?</i>

10:25.713 --> 10:27.758
Please, hit them!

10:28.009 --> 10:33.311
But not to worry. So long as I have you,
nothing will ever hit its mark.

10:40.074 --> 10:41.578
Let's find Andy!

10:41.578 --> 10:42.329
Okay!

10:43.999 --> 10:44.918
Tatiana!

10:44.918 --> 10:46.671
I know!

10:50.971 --> 10:52.809
Over there, Tatiana!

10:57.860 --> 10:58.570
Useless.

10:58.570 --> 11:01.785
I gave you an unrepairable wound...

11:03.287 --> 11:06.210
...and even told you the deactivation conditions.

11:06.628 --> 11:09.174
It won't repair itself till I die.

11:10.176 --> 11:15.771
At that point, the very act of trying
to kill me becomes another healing technique.

11:16.523 --> 11:23.411
I bet you think if you can just overcome Latla's ability,
you'll have a clear shot at me. But...

11:23.870 --> 11:24.873
You can't.

11:26.458 --> 11:31.468
The more you desire to live,
the more I negate you.

11:34.141 --> 11:36.186
Now, as for the rest...

11:38.357 --> 11:39.611
Chikara!

11:42.449 --> 11:43.367
H-Here he comes!

11:46.750 --> 11:50.591
I just need ya to stop 'im for an instant!
Find me and...

11:57.647 --> 11:58.899
You can do this!

12:02.865 --> 12:03.533
Yeah!

12:10.254 --> 12:14.931
I-I got you in the diagonal line between us...

12:16.768 --> 12:21.569
...so that Mr. Andy's body is hidden behind you!

12:21.945 --> 12:25.911
Sick! You guys are wicked sick!

12:27.163 --> 12:29.669
CRIMSON BULLET

12:34.136 --> 12:35.054
Oh?

12:38.520 --> 12:41.985
...you guys have got what it takes to put your lives on
the line and act to help others.

12:42.987 --> 12:46.995
So folks like that... do exist.

12:49.458 --> 12:50.627
Rip!

13:15.552 --> 13:19.519
Creed! Feng! You're in here, right?
Give me a hand!

13:25.321 --> 13:27.158
Wait! Just who...

13:27.785 --> 13:31.375
Who are you people?
What are you trying to accomplish?

13:34.757 --> 13:36.594
You should save that question for Rip.

13:37.095 --> 13:40.184
After all, he's definitely not dying today.

13:43.065 --> 13:45.529
What do you mean by that?

14:03.732 --> 14:04.942
They got away?

14:07.196 --> 14:09.492
Fuko! What about your wound?
Are you okay?

14:09.785 --> 14:15.004
Oh! So that is you, Tatiana!
Your hair is really pretty!

14:16.758 --> 14:19.220
Just tell me if you're okay!

14:19.597 --> 14:22.226
If you're worried 'bout Unrepair's wound, don't be.

14:22.477 --> 14:23.437
Andy!

14:23.980 --> 14:29.282
Firin' the Crimson Bullet slowed my regeneration,
but I'm gradually healin'.

14:30.326 --> 14:33.499
Unrepair's ability's been deactivated.

14:36.046 --> 14:37.967
Thank goodness.

14:51.788 --> 14:57.340
<i>The meteorite sent Andy bouncing off
the ocean's surface and into the sky...</i>

14:57.340 --> 15:01.098
<i>...sending him approximately 100 meters away from Rip.</i>

15:01.766 --> 15:06.526
<i>By distancing himself from his target
and sniping from out of sight,</i>

15:07.277 --> 15:09.322
<i>Andy hoped to break through Latla's defenses.</i>

15:09.824 --> 15:14.751
<i>He only had one chance. If he missed
and drew her attention, he wouldn't get a second shot.</i>

15:15.168 --> 15:18.007
<i>However, at 100 meters away,</i>

15:18.215 --> 15:24.812
<i>a normal Parts Bullet would've lost speed before reaching
its target, unable to deliver a fatal blow.</i>

15:26.190 --> 15:28.402
<i>Therefore, he made a crucial call.</i>

15:30.073 --> 15:34.624
<i>He focused all regeneration of blood
and calcium he had lost into his fingertip...</i>

15:34.874 --> 15:37.170
<i>...to fire off a super-pressurized Finger Bullet.</i>

15:38.172 --> 15:44.685
<i>A measure considerably impairing his regeneration
for several minutes, leaving him exposed.</i>

15:45.228 --> 15:47.691
<i>He always planned to protect everyone on his own.</i>

15:48.192 --> 15:49.779
<i>That is why he could never use it.</i>

15:52.200 --> 15:55.123
<i>But right now, he wasn't alone.</i>

15:57.293 --> 15:58.547
You can do this!

16:03.849 --> 16:07.815
Sick! You guys are wicked sick!

16:09.484 --> 16:11.990
Crimson Bullet!

16:17.041 --> 16:19.755
<i>Unrepair only made one miscalculation.</i>

16:20.464 --> 16:24.055
So folks like that... do exist.

16:24.264 --> 16:30.026
<i>There wasn't a single person present acting in
the interest of their own lives.</i>

16:38.125 --> 16:41.716
Fuko, sorry I wasn't able to protect ya.

16:43.010 --> 16:45.306
You held on like a champ with that wound.

16:47.895 --> 16:49.815
That was some damn fine Unluck.

16:54.449 --> 16:55.953
Tatiana.

16:55.953 --> 17:00.127
Thanks to your ability,
we were able to track down and corner that jerk.

17:05.221 --> 17:09.396
Whatever. I'm just making things right
for punching you before.

17:10.565 --> 17:12.778
And you, Chikara.

17:12.778 --> 17:16.661
I know this situation doesn't make a lick of sense,
but you did a good job helpin' us regardless.

17:24.050 --> 17:27.015
Oh, no, um... I just...

17:28.058 --> 17:32.066
I couldn't have beat him without you all.
Thanks, you guys!

17:32.317 --> 17:33.903
We did it, guys!

17:33.903 --> 17:36.659
Well, of course we did.
I'm here, after all!

17:36.659 --> 17:39.707
Oh, um, thanks for picking us up back ther-

17:40.959 --> 17:42.921
Don't look down here,
you perverted onion!

17:43.213 --> 17:44.466
Perverted onion?

17:48.600 --> 17:49.392
Hey, Chikara!

17:49.977 --> 17:50.979
Oh, yes?

17:51.438 --> 17:53.943
Why don't you come with us... to the Union?

17:59.329 --> 18:01.500
The Union?

18:01.876 --> 18:06.886
It's kind of hard to explain.
Not to mention, things can get pretty scary, too...

18:07.261 --> 18:12.105
So, I don't want to pressure you into joining, but...

18:12.648 --> 18:17.073
Um, hey, Andy? Could you keep Chikara
a secret from Ms. Juiz and the others?

18:17.490 --> 18:21.791
I sure as hell don't mind.
But is Tatiana gonna keep it under wraps?

18:24.295 --> 18:25.799
Tatiana.

18:30.684 --> 18:35.192
F-Fine, but only because we're friends!
And only this one time, okay?

18:35.192 --> 18:37.614
We're already short on members.

18:40.119 --> 18:44.587
It's true. The Boss will force him into
the group if she found out!

18:46.716 --> 18:50.055
Let's wait a week.
Use that time to make your choice.

18:50.807 --> 18:53.563
To decide on how you'll live as a Negator.

18:54.940 --> 18:56.151
A week...

19:26.127 --> 19:30.135
<i>You're going to meet a lot
of people over the course of your life.</i>

19:30.135 --> 19:34.728
<i>If you ever come across those that show you kindness...</i>

19:35.271 --> 19:37.191
Cherish those people.

19:37.776 --> 19:42.201
<i>If they are in trouble,
take a moment to pause...</i>

19:42.536 --> 19:46.794
<i>...and then get back in action
to help those people.</i>

19:47.295 --> 19:54.058
<i>If you do, I'm certain that... every one of those people...
will become irreplaceable to you.</i>

20:08.796 --> 20:11.176
YEAR 2020

20:11.176 --> 20:13.556
SEPTEMBER 16TH

20:13.556 --> 20:15.935
JAPAN

20:49.460 --> 20:51.966
Do you think Chikara will come?

20:52.801 --> 20:53.928
Who knows?

20:54.930 --> 21:01.151
We gave him a necktie translator, so as long as he
can hide his ability, he's just a regular kid.

21:04.282 --> 21:08.833
We told 'im to show up at the school gate
at five once he's made up his mind.

21:09.375 --> 21:10.335
Yeah.

21:11.129 --> 21:14.260
Ten minutes left.
If he doesn't come, we're outta here.

21:14.970 --> 21:15.722
Yeah.

21:21.066 --> 21:25.407
If his resolve ain't up to snuff, he's better off not joining.
He'll just wind up dead.

21:26.242 --> 21:30.083
You're right.
Everyone's only got one life to live.

21:32.379 --> 21:35.512
And if you end up dying,
there's no coming back.

21:40.020 --> 21:42.692
Actually, that's not as true as you think.

21:42.692 --> 21:43.861
Ah!

21:44.237 --> 21:49.205
Latla said you guys weren't here,
so I figured you would be.

21:49.413 --> 21:54.800
Unrepair? You're so small...
Wait, you survived? But how?

22:01.354 --> 22:05.947
TO BE CONTINUED

23:35.960 --> 23:36.754
PREVIEW

23:36.920 --> 23:41.429
<i>The battle is over, and the unlucky girl
and undead man wait for his decision.</i>

23:41.429 --> 23:44.519
<i>The troubled Unmove boy...
and there is no turning back.</i>

23:44.770 --> 23:48.151
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 15-UNDER.</i>

23:48.611 --> 23:50.489
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
